    {
      "tag": "SECTION",
      "text": "Help us tackle the world's biggest challenges. Whether you're an engineer, an AI researcher, a transportation expert, a business specialist, or a student looking to grow your career, Waabi is where you'll solve real problems for real vehicles on real roads\u2014while shaping entire industries.\n\nJoin the team",
      "cls": "careers-intro",
      "rect": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1084,
        "width": 768,
        "height": 572,
        "top": 1084,
        "right": 768,
        "bottom": 1656,
        "left": 0
      },
      "font": "16px Zagma, Georgia, serif",
      "tracking": "normal",
      "padding": "40px 0px",
      "gap": "normal",
      "background": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "SECTION",
      "text": "Pioneering tomorrow, together.\n\nWe wake up each day with a clear mission that goes far beyond technology\u2014we're empowering humanity to build a better tomorrow. Our team pours their expertise into pioneering a groundbreaking approach that no one else has dared to imagine.\n\nThis bold vision has propelled Waabi into a global force with every achievement reflecting the unwavering commitment of the Waabi team.",
      "cls": "careers-mission",
      "rect": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1716,
        "width": 768,
        "height": 1766,
        "top": 1716,
        "right": 768,
        "bottom": 3482,
        "left": 0
      },
      "font": "16px Zagma, Georgia, serif",
      "tracking": "normal",
      "padding": "60px 0px",
